# Ignored on purpose: these are outputs of a run, not artifacts.
#
# The image path is written by `build` so `promote` cannot silently build
# something else, and the digest/repository by `promote` so `pin` records what
# was actually pushed. All three are ephemeral and would be misleading if they
# were committed - they describe one run on one machine.
.oci-image-path
.digest
.repository

# nix build output symlink.
result
result-*
